; A fractional commodity swap must preserve the inferred loss even
; when its base currency has no display precision (#3314, #3258).
; The cost-side total lot price divides 3.14 EUR over 4 ETH; multiplying
; that per-unit basis by 0.48 ETH gives 0.3768 EUR, against the 1.2 EUR
; basis of the BTC given up.  The inferred loss is therefore 0.8232 EUR.
; A total lot on the source side likewise preserves the inferred loss:
; 1 EUR of BTC exchanged for 0.75 EUR of ETH leaves 0.25 EUR.

2025/01/04 Fractional swap with total cost-side lot price
    Assets:Coins     -0.12 BTC {10 EUR} @ 4 ETH {{3.14 EUR}}
    Assets:Coins      0.48 ETH {0.785 EUR}
    Assets:CostLotOffset

2025/01/05 Fractional swap with source total lot price
    Assets:Coins     -0.1250 BTC {{1.0 EUR}} @ 2 ETH {3 EUR}
    Assets:Coins      0.2500 ETH {3 EUR}
    Assets:SourceLotOffset

test bal --flat --no-total Offset
       EUR0.82320000  Assets:CostLotOffset
    EUR0.25000000000  Assets:SourceLotOffset
end test
